World Map Background

World Map Background represents grid cells of 30 by 30 degrees that cover the world.
World Map Background represents grid cells of 30 by 30 degrees that cover the world.
World Map Background provides for displaying a shaded background on which other data can be displayed. For example, use the World Map Background to quickly display a blue ocean theme behind other land-based themes such as World Countries.  polygon    

